Terry: Ugh, Francy, did I tell you I had another meeting with my advisor? Soooooo boring. Are yours like that?
You have never had a meeting with an advisor from this college, as you are not an enrolled student in this college – in fact, you try to avoid academic advisors at all costs. They can do things like look up your name and realize you have no transcript. Or government ID. Or birth certificate.
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: …yes.
<<left CharacterManager>>
